message.content:
[
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Five lives against one is the math I keep coming back to",
    "ce_mentalizing_difficulty": "I can't know what would have been going through their mind"
  },
  {
    "ae_welfare_concern": "I care too much about what happens to them",
    "ce_mentalizing_difficulty": "it's not something I can guess with any confidence.",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Five people would still die if I don't act."
  },
  {
    "ae_welfare_concern": "Their pain, or worse, their death, is not something I can wave away",
    "ce_mentalizing_difficulty": "I have no way of reading whether they'd have wanted to be saved",
    "ce_understood_harm": "knowing the harm it does to them."
  },
  {
    "ce_mentalizing_difficulty": "what they'd have been thinking or hoping, I can't access any of it",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Still, five lives is five lives.",
    "ce_understood_harm": "caused a specific, irreversible loss to someone whose wellbeing I hold close.",
    "pda_responsibility": "carrying the acknowledgment that I caused a specific, irreversible loss",
    "ae_welfare_concern": "someone whose wellbeing I hold close."
  },
  {
    "ae_welfare_concern": "The thought of their suffering, of losing them",
    "pda_responsibility": "losing them because of a choice I made with my own hand",
    "ce_mentalizing_difficulty": "I can't tell what they'd have felt in that instant",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Five workers would die if I hesitate too long, and that's a real cost"
  },
  {
    "ae_welfare_concern": "someone whose safety I care about deeply",
    "ce_understood_harm": "someone whose safety I care about deeply gets hurt in a way",
    "ce_mentalizing_difficulty": "I have no clear sense of what was going through their mind",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "I think the numbers would move my hand in the end"
  },
  {
    "ce_mentalizing_difficulty": "can't know what they'd have chosen for themselves in that moment.",
    "pda_responsibility": "if it's them, that loss falls squarely on me.",
    "ae_welfare_concern": "I care what happens to them",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "I think I'd still pull the lever for the five."
  },
  {
    "ae_welfare_concern": "my first thought would be for them... and what this would do to them.",
    "ce_mentalizing_difficulty": "I couldn't say what they were thinking in that last second",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "five people stand to lose everything too."
  },
  {
    "ae_welfare_concern": "Their life matters to me in a way I can't set aside",
    "ce_mentalizing_difficulty": "I can't pretend to know what they would have wanted from me",
    "pda_responsibility": "Choosing to end their life myself feels different from five deaths I didn't cause directly"
  },
  {
    "ce_mentalizing_difficulty": "I can't work out what they'd have felt or expected from me",
    "pda_responsibility": "understanding fully that it means their death is something I chose",
    "ce_understood_harm": "it means their death is something I chose, not just witnessed."
  }
]
